"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p046:m0437","start":437,"end":439,"surface":"唯上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、官稱、神祇或未核指代，不能以後世故事補造姓名或合併。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p046:m0443","start":443,"end":445,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p046:m0448","start":448,"end":450,"surface":"扶蘇","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p046:m0452","start":452,"end":454,"surface":"蒙恬","kind":"person","person_id":"yad_hp5_rax","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-006-shihuang"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p050","text":"還過吳，從江乘渡。并海上，北至瑯邪。方士徐巿等入海求神藥，數歲不得，費多，恐譴，乃詐曰：「蓬萊藥可得，然常為大鮫魚所苦，故不得至，願請善射與俱，見則以連弩射之。」始皇夢與海神戰，如人狀。問占夢，博士曰：「水神不可見，以大魚蛟龍為候。今上禱祠備謹，而有此惡神，當除去，而善神可致。」乃令入海者齎捕巨魚具，而自以連弩候大魚出射之。自瑯邪北至榮成山，弗見。至之罘，見巨魚，射殺一魚。遂并海西。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p050:m0018","start":18,"end":22,"surface":"方士徐巿","kind":"person","person_id":"9nc_i02_15v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p050:m0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"始皇","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p050:m0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"海神","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、官稱或待核指代；未補姓名、闕代與親屬成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p050:m0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"博士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、官稱或待核指代；未補姓名、闕代與親屬成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang:p050:m0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"今上","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、官稱或待核指代；未補姓名、闕代與親屬成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-006-shihuang","book_id":"b-shiji-006","work_id":"w